                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.5151/330: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Philip</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-06-19T13:00:00-04:00">June 19, 1936—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>58. My telegram No. 57, June 18, 3 p.m. Delay referred to involves the granting
                    of permits for dollar exchange.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Philip</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
